WEBVTT

00:18:27.307 --> 00:18:31.051
One that I just looked at
found 40% introvert,

00:18:31.075 --> 00:18:33.271
20% who would call themselves ambivert --

00:18:33.295 --> 00:18:36.968
who are people who really kind of feel
that they're in the middle of both --

00:18:36.992 --> 00:18:39.119
40% more on the extrovert side.

00:18:39.143 --> 00:18:44.977
But as you say, even within those poles,
there's no absolute.

00:18:45.001 --> 00:18:50.492
CA: It seems to me that
people's external persona

00:18:50.516 --> 00:18:52.955
and what they themselves feel
may be different.

00:18:52.979 --> 00:18:57.452
I think there's a lot of people
who look to be extroverts, but --

00:18:57.476 --> 00:18:58.645
SC: Yes. Oh, gosh.

00:18:58.669 --> 00:19:01.805
CA:... but if you were to actually
hear their internal dialogue,